d CI matrix arm by @u9g in https://github.com/livekit/livekit-cli/pull/893\r\n* fix(agent): trust the resolved livekit-agents version in the SDK check; add Windows test runner by @u9g in https://github.com/livekit/livekit-cli/pull/894\r\n* feat(agents): support attributes on deploy/list, json on all cmds by @rektdeckard in https://github.com/livekit/livekit-cli/pull/887\r\n* fix(deps): update dependency dotenv to v17 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/livekit/livekit-cli/pull/896\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/livekit/livekit-cli/pull/872\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/livekit/livekit-cli/compare/v2.16.7...v2.17.0","mentions_count":6}